# Cube of 20 mm, written by hand for tests/io-obj.test.ts.
# Two groups: Caps (top and bottom, no material) and Body (the four sides, material Steel).
# The file is Y up. Material state carries on in OBJ, so the group without one comes first.
mtllib cube.mtl

v -10 -10 -10
v  10 -10 -10
v  10  10 -10
v -10  10 -10
v -10 -10  10
v  10 -10  10
v  10  10  10
v -10  10  10

g Caps
s off
f 5 6 7 8
f 1 4 3 2

g Body
usemtl Steel
f 1 2 6 5
f 3 4 8 7
f 1 5 8 4
f 2 3 7 6
